{"id":"1e533b3046b04fd6","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-topo11-separable-space-witness.md","title":"ZFC Topo11 Separable Space Witness","display":"df-zfc-topo11-separable-space-witness — ZFC Topo11 Separable Space Witness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo11-separable-space-witness","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo11-separable-space-witness"],"display":"df-zfc-topo11-separable-space-witness — ZFC Topo11 Separable Space Witness","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo11-separable-space-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo11-separable-space-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo11-separable-space-witness — ZFC Topo11 Separable Space Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set\">58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (topological carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (topology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq X\">\\(D\\subseteq X\\)</span> (countable dense subset witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\)</span> (dense-set predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\)</span> (countable-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11SeparableSpaceWitness}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11SeparableSpaceWitness}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}separable\\text{-}space\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11SeparableSpaceWitness}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(D)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}separable\\text{-}space\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11SeparableSpaceWitness}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(D)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Countability and density both use their registered predicates; density also validates the topology and the inclusion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq X\">\\(D\\subseteq X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S$ (dense-set predicate; see [[58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11SeparableSpaceWitness}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}separable\\text{-}space\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11SeparableSpaceWitness}_S(D,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(D)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)","display":true},{"tex":"D\\subseteq X","display":false}],"bytes":1199,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3693","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-topo11-separable-space-witness.md|58-df-zfc-topo11-separable-space-witness]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","855dfa27460aa1ec","f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0"]}